# > Gate (Gate.io / Gate.com) & Gate Web3 全终端覆盖

# 1. User-Agent 规则：精准捕获 iOS/Android/桌面端 App 的流量
USER-AGENT,Gateio*
USER-AGENT,*gateio*
USER-AGENT,GateWeb3*
USER-AGENT,*gateweb3*
USER-AGENT,com.gateio.*
USER-AGENT,com.gate.*

# 2. 域名后缀规则：匹配 Web 端主站、App 底层 API、备用防封域名及静态资源 CDN
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gate.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gate.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gate.ac
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gate.biz
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gate.cx
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gate.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gate.trade
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gate.tech
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gateio.ch
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gateio.services
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gateio.live
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gateio.ws
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gateapi.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gate-api.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gateimg.com

# Gate Web3 钱包及 GateChain 链上生态接口
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gateweb3.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gateweb3.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gateweb3.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gatechain.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gatescan.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gatenode.cc

# 3. 关键字规则：兜底拦截，覆盖其可能遗漏的短链接、第三方客服或验证组件
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,gateio
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,gateweb3
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,gatechain
